        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-5891a4f69d@example.invalid",
          "topPadding": "2",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Dec 22 2020 00:28:09 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">You only get one chance to launch your ASC.<br>\n </span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">We help you do it right.</span></span></span></span><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Building a successful ASC starts by choosing a partner who’s dedicated to your success from day one. Supported by a team that’s partnered with hundreds of Ambulatory Surgery Centers (ASCs) across the country, you’ll have the insight and support to create a space that delivers outcomes and impact for years to come.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Wherever you are in your journey, from drafting ambulatory surgery center floor plans and reviewing design guidelines to clinical planning and product selection, we’re here for you. Our dedicated people, resources and ASC programs provide everything you need for peace of mind as your vision comes to life.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Jun 03 2025 20:22:45 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
