      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">ASC New Build Playbook</span></span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">We're here to share our ASC expertise and experience to be your partner throughout this complex new build ASC construction process. Our ASC New Build Playbook was developed through collaboration with 10+ physician ASC owners and faculty across the United States. Explore the development phases of the build process below and <a href=\"#contact\">request access to the full resource</a>.</span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Jun 03 2025 20:59:57 GMT+0000",
